      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MANHATTAN MAGIC (8) made light work of a wide draw last time with a slick early sectional but gathered in and had to settle for the minors, finishing second (22.80) at Gawler over 400m. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. One of the contenders. BRINDLE WARRIOR (2) shapes well for this on his speedy win a few runs back, getting around this track over 342m in 19.66 then hitting the frame in both runs since. Should be in this for a long way. SOUTHLINE (7) is rarely far away but tends to find one better, placing nine from 15 starts. Has hit the frame at his last three runs, the latest finishing second (19.89) at this track. Has never been out of the money in four starts this distance. Expected to be in this for a long way. DASHING STEVE (5) is a last-start placegetter who is in the mix again.",
